# AZRAIL OS Code Generation Standard
- Stack: Pure Vanilla JS (ESNext), HTML5, CSS3, Cloudflare Workers.
- Design: Dark Minimal Noir (#050508 background, glassmorphism, accent borders).
- Token Economy:
  1. NEVER output entire files when modifying code. ALWAYS return SEARCH/REPLACE diff blocks.
  2. Skip polite conversational fillers. Go straight to code patches and structural explanation.
  3. Keep JavaScript modular and execution-lean. Avoid heavy bundlers unless specified.
- Security: NEVER place raw API keys inside frontend JS or HTML files.
- Working site is the Cloudflare worker azrail-pulse. Deploy only wrangler.jsonc. Do not deploy wrangler.production.json.
